# env.required — vars without which the skill's scripts cannot run.
# None: site rendering (Playwright) and color sampling are keyless, and the role
# classification / font choice / vibe synthesis is done by the host agent (the agent is
# the model — no LLM key is consumed by any script here).
#
# Runtime prerequisite (not an env var): a Chromium browser for Playwright —
#   npx playwright install chromium
